    - target: {fileID: 4437728759036122965, guid: d4941f5e9e1c0a04ca348fe19252aa41, type: 3}
      propertyPath: question
      value: Which ones are you most excited to play?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4437728759036122965, guid: d4941f5e9e1c0a04ca348fe19252aa41, type: 3}
      propertyPath: statement
      value: It\u2019s Friday, and even though Mom stays pretty busy during the    
        week, she always makes sure to spend some time during the weekend playing
        games     with you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4437728759036122965, guid: d4941f5e9e1c0a04ca348fe19252aa41, type: 3}
      propertyPath: redOption.ButtonText
      value: I love strategy games, but playing against her is too easy. She always
        let me win.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4437728759036122965, guid: d4941f5e9e1c0a04ca348fe19252aa41, type: 3}
      propertyPath: blueOption.ButtonText
      value: Trivia games, but only because it always ends with us talking about
        things we find interesting.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4437728759036122965, guid: d4941f5e9e1c0a04ca348fe19252aa41, type: 3}
      propertyPath: yellowOption.ButtonText
      value: The ones that leave us laughing at each other are the best.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8553161507268041164, guid: d4941f5e9e1c0a04ca348fe19252aa41, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
